<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel FELS sees substantially lower 1997.</title>
<headline>Keppel FELS sees substantially lower 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Group shipbuilding unit Keppel FELS (FELS) said on Monday that its directors expect 1997 results to be substantially lower than 1996 as there are no major completions this year.</p>
<p>FELS reported net profit of Singapore $54.36 million for 1996, up 18.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
